{"product_id":"taom-chalk","title":"TAOM Chalk","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltimate Grip. Maximum Control. Minimal Residue.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTAOM V10 Professional Chalk\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a premium billiard chalk handmade in Finland and engineered for players who demand exceptional cue-ball grip without sacrificing a clean playing experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIts latest-generation formula provides \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003estrong friction between the cue tip and cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, giving players the confidence to apply English, draw, follow, and other demanding shots while maintaining a smooth and controlled feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned to work with \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eall cue-tip hardnesses, from soft to hard\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, V10 offers consistent performance across different playing styles and cuesports.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose TAOM V10?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltimate Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides exceptional tip-to-ball friction for confident cue-ball control\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaximum Spin Potential\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain grip when applying English and demanding spin\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMinimal Resi